WEBVTT

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:05.440
Arte had her hands full
with you until recently, huh?

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.980
But now all she's doing
is painting Mother's portrait.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:12.690
That's her real job, you know.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.730
You've commissioned a portrait
from her, too, right?

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.030
You'll be able to see her then.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:22.650
That's true, but it's nothing
compared to before.

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:28.150
Besides, once she finishes the portraits,
she's going home, right?

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:08.040
"The Faliers' Portrait Painter"

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:08.230
Huh? You're coming with me to
tour the workshop, Katarina?

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:11.480
Yes. Uncle Yuri gave me permission.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:13.780
He thought maybe I could learn something, too.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:16.730
Just what could she learn...?

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:19.360
Come on, let's go, Arte!

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.650
Oh, well.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:38.150
Hello, what are you doing?

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.940
I-I'm making paint...

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.230
Do you paint, too?

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:47.730
Well, I'm still a lowly beginning apprentice...

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:50.480
What's going on? Why are
there so many girls here?

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:53.570
They said the Falier family
is here to tour the workshop.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:56.230
That's the daughter of the Falier family, huh?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:59.730
Does that mean she's the daughter
of the famous Lady Sofia?

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.780
That makes sense.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.150
Wow... A huge panel painting...

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:15.190
That painting is for the
grand hall in the mansion.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:20.440
I've heard from the master that
I'm to show you around the workshop.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:22.480
My name is Matei.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:26.280
Sorry to make you take time
out of your busy day for this.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:29.070
No, I'm the one who's sorry.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.860
What is this?

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:33.980
You lot! Don't paint half-hearted paintings.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:40.980
As you can see, the master is a busy man,
so you've been left with an apprentice like me.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.650
Um, Matei.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.030
Hm?

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:52.610
You weren't surprised to find out
that I'm a female painter?

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:58.110
I did think it was unusual for a woman
to want to be a painter, but I thought,

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.940
there are people like that, too.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:05.110
We're both studying to become painters,
so we're the same, huh?

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.440
More importantly,

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:10.690
I was surprised that the daughter of
the Falier family is accompanying you.

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.690
This is the first time I've seen
so many girls in the workshop.

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:19.940
I'm sorry. It's because I'm her tutor...

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:23.610
Her tutor? At the Falier house?

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:27.780
Then, do you also come from a noble family?

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:32.690
Oh, nothing like the Faliers, though...

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:39.530
But because of that, I was asked to come here
from Florence as a portrait painter.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:42.650
You are also well-educated, then.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.150
That's amazing.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.070
N-Not at all...

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.230
It's wonderful.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:53.980
I've been working here for years,
but I haven't caught anyone's eye yet.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:58.730
It's not just me. That's what
it's like for most apprentices.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:04.900
You're from a noble family with an education,
and a rare female painter.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.480
It really is wonderful.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:09.610
I'm envious.

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.610
Arte?

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.320
Let's stop here for today.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.360
Thanks, Katarina.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:30.360
Oh, we're finally done!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.570
I've got knots in my shoulders.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:37.150
Hey, after this, there's a recipe
I want to show you.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:42.820
Oh, I'm sorry. I need to study art after this.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:49.150
But we always talk after these sessions.
I was looking forward to it.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:54.280
Sorry, sorry. Let's talk later,
when I have time.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.150
When you have time...?

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.570
Later!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.650
Oh? What about Arte?

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:13.900
She said she would not be at dinner today
because she is busy with work.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:26.530
Was she working all day today, too?

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:29.360
Yes. She said she wanted to focus.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.150
What about tomorrow?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.900
I think she's going to sketch at the church?

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:38.190
Again? I never get to see Arte anymore.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.610
Ever since that day...

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:45.980
Ever since we got back from that workshop.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:53.230
Arte, are you going out?

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:56.110
Yeah, to the church, to sketch.

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.070
Are you all right?

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:02.280
The light in your room's been on late recently.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:04.610
You haven't been sleeping much, have you?

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:08.320
I-I'm fine. I-I'll be back later.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.690
Daphne!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:20.360
Hasn't Arte been strange recently?

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.400
She hasn't had time to talk,

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.150
and she seems to be keeping
herself strangely busy.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.650
It's been bothering me, too.

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:33.280
It's as if she thinks eating is a waste of time
and doesn't touch the food left for her.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:37.440
It looks like she's also studying
art late into the night.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:40.280
I know she's always studied hard,

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:43.440
but it feels like she's forcing
herself to be busy recently...

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:03.360
I need to study more.

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:08.570
You're from a noble family with an education,
and a rare female painter.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:11.400
It really is wonderful.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.400
I'm envious.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:19.230
I think he said that, not out of spite,
but because he really has been suffering.

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:24.150
But when he said that to me,
all I could do was laugh foolishly.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:27.780
I got work because I'm female and a noble.

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:30.860
I mean, that's true.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:35.820
This whole time, I'd been told I <i>couldn't</i>
do it because I was female and a noble.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:41.730
Because that was the adversity I face,
I should've just kept looking forward.

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:44.070
But...

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:46.980
...suddenly being told the opposite
of what I'd been told until now

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:50.360
made it feel like it was rejecting
who I'd been until now.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:57.150
I couldn't do nothing.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:06.070
I thought maybe I'd feel better if
I worked harder than I ever had before.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.440
Leo...

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:15.280
Leo...

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:24.280
Leo...

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:26.940
Leo...

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.730
Okay, who had three loaves?

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.150
Me!

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.610
Oof.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:52.900
Speaking of which, I haven't
seen the girl recently.

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:56.780
I'd been wondering about her, too.
I wonder how she's been...

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:02.570
Here. I finished all the errands you had.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:06.940
Here.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.440
Oh, yeah, you had a female apprentice, right?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.360
You didn't need me after she came.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.110
Did she leave?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:23.400
Um... never mind...

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:42.150
Here's the drawing you ordered. Take a look.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.570
That was faster than expected.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:50.280
The workshop was quiet,
so I made better progress than usual.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:53.900
Hmm, it's not bad. It's fine.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.690
You can take this to the woodcarver.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.070
Okay.

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:04.690
Hey.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:08.440
There's a job I'd like you to do.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:13.650
I want you to paint the ceiling mural for
a church being built nearby by Easter.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:17.230
The master artisan of the workshop
I'd been planning to use passed away.

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:21.320
There's not much time to work,
but it's a pretty big job.

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:22.860
How about it?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:27.150
Of course I'll do it.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.360
U-Um...

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:52.820
When is, uh, Miss Arte coming back...?

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:54.860
Who are you?

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:56.190
Huh?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.900
It's been a while, huh?

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:03.480
How many days has it been
since you've been here?

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:06.110
Will you leave me alone?

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:10.150
Recently there've been too many
people trying to talk to me.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:12.530
I'm tired.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:17.230
People are talking to <i>you</i> ? There must be
a lot of strange people out there.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:29.110
Leo!

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.570
Leo...

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.900
I think she's overworked.

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:46.070
Thank you.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:48.820
Don't push yourself to move!

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:53.070
I... I...

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:58.900
She did not touch her food today, either,
so I looked inside, and...

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:02.110
Uncle called the doctor.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:05.030
Katarina, you go back to
your room and go to sleep.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.110
Okay.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.030
Arte, rest well.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:13.280
I'll bring something for you to eat.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:23.690
Now, I'd like to be worried about your health,

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:29.530
but first, I cannot forgive you
for making my niece cry.

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:37.400
While you were passed out,
Katarina was upset enough to cry.

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:38.480
I...

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.110
I'm not interested in your situation.

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:45.320
If it's going to make that girl cry,
then please stop working yourself so hard.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:48.150
This is an order from your employer.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.610
Daphne, have you seen Lady Katarina?

00:14:57.610 --> 00:14:58.730
No.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:02.900
Oh, dear. It's almost time for
her arithmetic lesson, too.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.980
Hm?

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:12.070
Lady Katarina! Your teacher's waiting!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.070
I feel like someone's watching me recently.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.280
You mean, Lady Katarina?

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.820
Maybe I'm just imagining it.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:35.280
I... don't think you're imagining it.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:42.820
Lady Katarina is worried about you.
She even came and asked me about you.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.150
Katarina!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:57.480
Don't worry so much! I won't work
so hard anymore, so don't worry!

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:01.110
I won't pass out again. I promise!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.320
Really?

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:10.480
I-It's not like I was worried.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.480
I wasn't worried, got that?!

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:24.530
What's that?

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:29.690
I'm designing the jewelry
you'll wear in your portrait.

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:30.820
Me?

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:34.030
Yeah, look.

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:36.690
Oh, they're pretty.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:41.320
I went to a bunch of different workshops
so I could sketch different ones.

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:45.230
Then, I used those as reference
to come up with these designs.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:48.440
Wow, you did all that?

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.150
Of course.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:56.360
For portraits, we do everything
we can to satisfy the customer.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.980
The angle and color of the face,
the amount of light,

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:03.570
the clothes and ornaments worn--
we take all that and more into account.

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:11.730
The design of the jewelry and lace
is an opportunity to show our skill.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.570
Those sensibilities are what
elevate us as painters.

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:15.940
I see.

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:20.480
For religious paintings,
you also need a lot of education.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:23.860
It's a lot of work to be a painter.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:28.690
Katarina, what's the matter?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:32.320
I'm studying properly as a noble.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:36.940
Because this is what I must do right now.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.780
Oh?

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.980
I'm still working on Lady Sofia's,

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:46.400
but I finished yours first and wanted
to show you as soon as possible.

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:48.360
I made the frame, too.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.820
What do you think?

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:01.030
You don't like it?

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:04.280
Come with me!

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.530
Huh?!

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.690
Katarina, wait!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.190
Hey, you!

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:20.980
What's the matter? What do you need today?

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:27.820
Well, um... look! It's amazing, right?

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.320
Arte can paint such an amazing painting.

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:38.190
She's not just working because
she's a noble and female!

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:40.110
Hey, stop that!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:43.530
Sorry for the sudden interruption.

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:45.070
Come on, let's go.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:52.190
Jeez, you surprised me, Katarina.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.280
I didn't know what you were going to do.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:57.280
Come on, don't ignore me.

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.980
You were listening, huh?
At the workshop the other day.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:09.980
But what he said then was true.
It's not something to be angry about.

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:11.690
You <i>should</i> be angry!

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:16.480
But I'm more mad at you than I am at that man.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:19.150
When I saw Gimo at Murano Island...

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.480
Because you're a noble.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:25.360
That's why we can't see each other anymore.
That's what he said to me.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:30.280
But like Gimo said, we can't
choose or change our birth.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:35.690
That's why I accepted it.
That I'm the daughter of nobles.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:39.480
What about you, Arte?
You can't change your birth either.

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:43.440
Even if someone says they're jealous. Right?

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:50.730
Yuri!

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:55.730
Hey, I wanted to talk to you about something,
so I've been waiting for you.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:59.570
Is that Katarina's portrait?

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:01.570
This is...

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:02.900
And Katarina?

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:04.610
She already saw it.

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:06.190
What did she say?

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:11.940
Katarina brought the portrait to the
workshop we toured the other day.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.610
And then...

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:18.820
You're from a noble family with an education,
and a rare female painter.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.440
It really is wonderful.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.320
I'm envious.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:26.320
She showed this painting to the man
who said that without any ill intent.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.320
Arte can paint such an amazing painting.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:33.530
She's not just working because
she's a noble and female!

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:35.900
...and said that.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:40.530
And then, she said that since we
can't choose or change our birth,

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:44.730
she's accepted the fact that she's a noble...

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:51.230
I was right to bring you here.

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:52.570
Huh?

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:55.980
Arte, will you...?

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.940
Would you like to stay in Venice?

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:07.070
If you'll stay, then I'll become your patron
and give you enough support to live on.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:10.980
I promise you a life that you
can be satisfied with.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:22.440
You wouldn't have suggested that if I hadn't
been a woman and a noble, right?

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:26.690
You said something similar
before you came, too, didn't you?

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:29.860
Isn't it disrespectful to the other
painters who aren't as blessed

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:35.230
to turn down work because of that?

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:37.360
I'll wait for your answer.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:41.780
Please think about it until you finish
my sister-in-law's portrait.

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:56.320
Sooner or later, you will have
to leave this workshop

00:21:56.320 --> 00:22:03.320
and get work with your own abilities
to put food on the table.

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:05.820
The job this time is a good opportunity.

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:10.190
Think carefully about what
I just said when you're in Venice.

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:14.780
I think, if the result is that when you
finish your job in six months,

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:18.190
you don't come back here, that's fine, too.

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:59.440
"Preview"

00:23:56.530 --> 00:23:59.860
I've met so many people
and been helped by so many.

00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:03.820
All of that has opened up my path
and led me to the future.

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:04.750
But I'm the one who will choose
which path I will walk on.

00:24:04.780 --> 00:24:11.050
"Apprentice"

00:24:07.530 --> 00:24:11.030
I'll move forward with the life I've decided on!
